{"title":"Career Roadmap · Digital Health Executive","role":"Digital Health Executive","summary":"A Digital Health Executive works at the intersection of healthcare, technology, operations and patient services. The role supports the implementation and day-to-day management of digital healthcare systems such as telemedicine platforms, electronic health records, digital patient-engagement systems, remote monitoring solutions and healthcare applications.","facts":{"Current degree":"Allied Health Sciences (B.Sc / BPT / BOT / BMLT etc.)","Course":"Tele-health / Digital Health Technology"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Digital Health Executive works at the intersection of healthcare, technology, operations and patient services. The role supports the implementation and day-to-day management of digital healthcare systems such as telemedicine platforms, electronic health records, digital patient-engagement systems, remote monitoring solutions and healthcare applications."},{"type":"p","text":"Typical responsibilities may include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Managing digital-health workflows"},{"text":"Supporting telemedicine operations"},{"text":"Coordinating patients and healthcare professionals"},{"text":"Managing digital health platforms"},{"text":"Monitoring service quality and KPIs"},{"text":"Supporting EHR/EMR implementation"},{"text":"Managing digital patient journeys"},{"text":"Preparing healthcare reports and dashboards"},{"text":"Coordinating technology and clinical teams"},{"text":"Supporting healthcare data governance"},{"text":"Training users on digital systems"}]},{"type":"p","text":"This is primarily a healthcare-technology and operations career, rather than an independent clinical practice role."}]},{"heading":"Career Pathway","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"flow","items":["Class 12 – Relevant Eligibility","Allied Health / Healthcare / Digital Health-relate